<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 11.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 11.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- Some truck drivers are still trying to pass over a flooded stretch of the Zimbabwe-Beira highway, despite the danger of being swept into the Pungue river.</p>
<p>- World Bank president, James Wolfensohn, is due in Mozambique on Friday as part of an African tour aimed at finding ways to promote development in the region.</p>
</text>
